  "about": {
    "description": "MONY is J.P. Morgan Asset Management's tokenized money market fund structured as a Rule 506(c) private placement on Ethereum, designed to provide U.S. dollar yield from a portfolio limited to U.S. Treasury securities and repurchase agreements collateralized by U.S. Treasuries. Subscriptions and redemptions are processed daily, the minimum subscription is $1,000,000. The fund charges a 0.16% management fee and is supported by JPMorgan Chase & Co. for custody and fund administration,",
